# 0278 = 0277 + TX recovery trigger re-gated to the real jam signature:
#   FIFO not empty && TXPKTRDY clear (the QMU already fetched the GPDs, so
#   inflight is 0 and FIFOFULL is often clear).  A healthy pending packet
#   has TXPKTRDY set and never triggers.
